/flood","ends":"2026-09-25T06:00:00-06:00","severity":"Severe","areaDesc":"Southwest San Juan Mountains; San Juan River Basin","id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.c86447dd54a169ae9df7d6c5b6b9b0c629575548.002.1","url":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.c86447dd54a169ae9df7d6c5b6b9b0c629575548.002.1"}],"afd":{"office":"GJT","issued":"2026-09-22T11:22:00+00:00","snippet":"000 FXUS65 KGJT 221122 AFDGJT Area Forecast Discussion National Weather Service Grand Junction CO 522 AM MDT Tue Sep 22 2026 .KEY MESSAGES... - Wetter weather returns to the region by Tuesday, with showers and storms possible each day through the end of the work week. - There is a potential for moderate and heavy rainfall that could lead to flooding mainly in the southern San Juans and surrounding","url":"https://forecast.weather.gov/product.php?site=GJT&issuedby=GJT&product=AFD&format=CI"},"hwo":null,"fwf":{"office":"GJT","issued":"2026-09-22T07:51:00+00:00","snippet":".DISCUSSION... Moisture returns today bringing increased clouds and chances for showers and thunderstorms. The best chances for wetting rains will be over the San Juans but any higher terrain will still see the possibility for a shower or storm. Precip chances continue through week keeping critical fire weather conditions minimal. ...GUSTY ERRATIC WINDS CAN BE EXPECTED NEAR ANY SHOWERS OR THUNDERS","url":"https://forecast.weather.gov/product.php?site=GJT&issuedby=GJT&product=FWF&format=CI"},"coagmet":{"station_id":"lbn01","station_name":"Lebanon","distance_km":5.4,"soil_temp_5cm_f":63.97,"soil_temp_15cm_f":66.02,"soil_moisture_5cm":null,"soil_moisture_15cm":null,"precip_in":null,"eto_in":null,"vapor_pressure":null,"solar_radiation":522.17,"wind_speed_mph":11,"air_temp_f":71.19,"relative_humidity":0.304,"url":"https://coagmet.colostate.edu/station/lbn01"},"aviation":{"icao":"KCEZ","distance_km":0,"raw_metar":"METAR KCEZ 221653Z AUTO VRB04G20KT 10SM CLR 23/06 A3020 RMK AO2 SLP162 T02330056","temp_f":74,"wind_dir":"VRB","wind